EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I've seen a greater selection of fish
than this at the supermarket.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I hope the rest of the museum has
more to offer{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Hay una mayor variedad de peces
en el mercado que aquí.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Espero que el resto del museo
no sea igual{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Süpermarkette bile bundan daha geniş
balık seçkisi gördüm.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Umarım müzenin geri
kalanı daha fazlasını sunuyordur{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

ES:
La colección crece poco a poco,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}
pero todavía quedan muchos peces
interesantes por descubrir.

{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Mira qué peces tan bonitos{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}
Pero seguro que hay otros mucho
más sorprendentes ahí fuera.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}That fish looks awfully familiar.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Where have I seen it before?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}I've never seen it before—but it
looks exactly like {{TAG:0005:0003:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
doesn't it? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
